    "body": "**Help wanted: GPU verification.** The core agents' test runs can't reach a GPU, so every render test reports \"No suitable graphics adapter found\". If your machine renders GPU tests (Windows, Linux, or macOS outside a sandbox), please run this on the PR branch and post the output:\n```\ncargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib ortho\ncargo test -p camcraft-ui --test gpu_render\n```\nThen, in **Ortho**, run Simulate (the traced stock view) and pick a vertex. Both should match what perspective shows (#609, #610).",
